  "finding": "The source §7 recovery includes clearing this round of operations and restoring all initial values. The full baseline correctly includes both, but the actual recovery-design section expressly limits the source rule result to the four initial field values, classifying selection/feedback clearing as design without retaining the distinct source clearing action. Correct source attribution in the separate baseline does not repair this local exclusive attribution. The finding is the actual source/design exclusion, not four-value shorthand alone.",
